+Optional iCloud pin sync is off by default and is available only in configured
+builds. If you enable it, the app sends minimal pin identifiers and order,
+server/account scope digests, random device identifiers, logical edit/removal
+markers and a reset identifier to your private CloudKit database through Apple.
+These identifiers can describe your library choices; hashes are not encryption
+or a promise of anonymity. Pin titles, artwork, server addresses, credentials,
+playback, queues and downloaded media are not included in this pin-sync payload.
+Each device resolves pin references using its own authorized library. Apple
+processes iCloud account and service information under its own policies.
+
+Pin sync does not enable Handoff or synchronize other library/account data.
+Other new features require their own accurate disclosures before they ship.

