+Turning pin sync off keeps the device's current local pins and stops new sync
+operations; already-submitted requests may finish. Cloud pins remain after you
+disable sync or sign out of VelaCanto. Delete Cloud-Saved Pins is a separate
+confirmed action for the current library/account: it clears cloud pin identities
+and order and retains an empty reset record so stale offline devices do not
+restore the old pins. Other enabled devices reconcile on their next sync. This
+does not promise removal from Apple's historical backups or storage history.
+Local sync journals use ordinary device preferences and are removed with local
+account cleanup; older device backups may retain them. You can keep using local
+pins during iCloud outages. An iCloud account change stops sync pending review.
+
